# Calendar the skills write interviews and assessment deadlines to (scripts/calendar.mjs). Copy this
# file to .calendar.env in your workspace and set CALENDAR_NAME to one of the names that
#   node scripts/calendar.mjs calendars
# prints. On macOS that is Calendar.app: to have the events in Google Calendar, add the Google account
# in System Settings > Internet Accounts with Calendars on and pick its calendar here (often named
# after the address). macOS asks once whether the terminal (or Claude) may control Calendar; allow it.
# On Windows it is classic Outlook (untested); leave CALENDAR_NAME empty for Outlook's default calendar.
CALENDAR_NAME=
#
# Optional: force a transport instead of the one for this OS (applecal or outlook).
# CALENDAR_TRANSPORT=applecal
